        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did all these slimes come from?! Something must be done about these icky sticky oozes! These ooey gooey sludges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168670/extras/3da1d4208f7a4a2b6566be491f4a52e7.poster.avif?t=1783634639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168670/extras/3da1d4208f7a4a2b6566be491f4a52e7.webm?t=1783634639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168670/extras/3da1d4208f7a4a2b6566be491f4a52e7.mp4?t=1783634639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hmmm. That sounds like a job for you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the slime drone.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squelch all of the mutinous marauder mucks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick perks and which enemies you'll see next in between rounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cool stuff.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat sticky tricky bosses!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate your short lived victory as the slimes infest a different map...</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did all these slimes come from?! Something must be done about these icky sticky oozes! These ooey gooey sludges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168670/extras/3da1d4208f7a4a2b6566be491f4a52e7.poster.avif?t=1783634639\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168670/extras/3da1d4208f7a4a2b6566be491f4a52e7.webm?t=1783634639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4168670/extras/3da1d4208f7a4a2b6566be491f4a52e7.mp4?t=1783634639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hmmm. That sounds like a job for you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the slime drone.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squelch all of the mutinous marauder mucks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick perks and which enemies you'll see next in between rounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cool stuff.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat sticky tricky bosses!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate your short lived victory as the slimes infest a different map...</p></li></ul>",
